WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
After Kurata

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Begin the Digimon Annihilation Strategy!

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.410
After Kurata!

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:09.550
Begin the Digimon Annihilation Strategy!

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:14.380
With DATS broken up, Masaru and the others' memories were erased.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:20.580
But their deep bond with their Digimon could not be broken.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:28.380
Reunited, the group ran towards DATS headquarters to stop Kurata's secret ploy.

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:34.740
Ikuto!

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:34.740
Ikuto!

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:36.450
Don't come here!

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.410
Run away, everyone!

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:44.100
No way!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.220
Why is this...?

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:52.640
Game is over!

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.590
Now everything about DATS, both in name and in reality, is destroyed!

00:00:57.930 --> 00:00:58.940
Kurata!

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:00.300
You were responsible for that?

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:02.300
Did you enjoy it?

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:06.600
This flashy spectacle show is quite a rare sight!

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:07.930
Cut the crap!

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:11.520
You're seriously not getting away this time!

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:13.940
What?

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:18.350
How unfortunate for you.

00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:21.660
Now you can no longer ruin my plans!

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.030
A space-time oscillation bomb!

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:30.530
See you never again!

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:36.550
Damn it...

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.710
KURATA!

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:43.010
Damn!

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:47.270
That Kurata is going to pay!

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:48.900
We're really sorry.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:52.980
We may be putting you two in danger for sheltering us.

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:55.940
We'll be okay.

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:57.260
Don't worry about us.

00:01:57.260 --> 00:02:00.450
Kurata has Digimon supporting him.

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:01.950
What?

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:05.350
He's right. I've never seen those Digimon before.

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:07.160
They were fearfully strong.

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:11.940
At this rate, the Digimon will really get slaughtered!

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:15.590
This is the worst of the worst!

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:17.750
We must defeat him!

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:18.510
At all costs!

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:21.510
We'll have to defend the Digital World using our own strength!

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:25.060
You're...

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:27.540
going back to the Digital World again?

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:30.120
Kurata is trying to destroy the Digimon!

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:31.770
We can't let him get what he wants!

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:35.730
Be careful.

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:38.190
Don't strain yourself.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:39.190
Yeah!

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:40.740
But...

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:44.640
Kurata destroyed the transportation equipment along with DATS's headquarters.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.410
How are we going to make a Digital Dive?

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:48.370
Damn it...

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:50.830
There is one possibility.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:52.490
Captain!

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:52.490
Captain!

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:56.090
That man is our last hope.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.050
That man?

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:14.450
I've brought room service!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.450
Sing a Song!

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:29.180
Daimon-kun!

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.390
By "that man," he meant...

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:35.020
<i>I'm Noguchi Kenji.</i>

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:36.400
<i>Ikuto's father.</i>

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.100
Ikuto's dad?!

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:39.470
You came without even knowing that?

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:41.880
Of course I knew! I was just making sure!

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:43.410
He didn't know.

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:44.840
Yeah.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.090
Professor Noguchi.

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:48.190
We need your help.

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:50.870
Please open the Digital Gate once more.

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:55.090
Will we...

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:59.040
Will we really get to see Ikuto?

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:00.450
Of course!

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:01.800
Don't worry about it!

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.260
Thank you.

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:06.300
I've been worried since I've caused him so much sorrow.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:09.570
In any case, the Ministry of Confidentiality sure is cruel.

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:11.430
Shutting them up in a hotel and all.

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:14.220
They wanted to monopolize the Professor's intellect for their own purposes.

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:15.230
Crap, they know!

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:18.730
It's locked!

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:24.330
Master!

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:26.990
Aniki! Hurry!

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:28.520
Agumon!

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:31.030
5 meters high

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:43.550
Damn it, out of the way!

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:50.410
What was that?

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:51.280
Who cares?!

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.470
Put the pedal to the metal!

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:17.970
I wonder if Masaru and the others are okay...

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:20.330
I'm sure it's going well.

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:29.090
My father...

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:30.420
And mother...

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:31.860
Ikuto...

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:37.470
Ikuto...

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:41.300
Ikuto!

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:45.180
Ikuto, you're okay.

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:46.460
You're hurt.

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:47.780
What happened?

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:57.490
Please, stop involving yourself in these dangerous things and live with us as a family.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:06:59.160
Ikuto.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:05.500
I have request.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:07.460
What is it?

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:10.690
I... want to go to Digital World.

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:12.470
I want to protect the Digimon!

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:15.390
Ikuto...

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:18.580
Digital World might be destroyed.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.000
I have to go no matter what!

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:20.520
You can't!

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:23.350
I don't want you leaving me again, Ikuto!

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:25.230
I never want you out of my sight!

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:30.570
Understood.

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:36.950
Kurosaki-san just confirmed that the Digital Gate transportation equipment in Professor Noguchi's basement is all in one piece.

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:39.020
Professor Noguchi.

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:42.220
Our situation is exactly as we explained it before.

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:45.040
We need you to open the Digital Gate for us.

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:46.410
Please!

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:48.750
We want to save the Digital World!

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:49.980
But...

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:55.510
My apologies, but I cannot help you.

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:57.800
Why?!

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.140
Your equipment works!

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:00.420
Well...

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:04.630
My research was incomplete.

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:07.500
I don't believe I can open the Digital Gate safely.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:08.650
No way!

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:11.360
You won't know if it'll fail or not unless you try first!

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:13.970
We're all asking for your help...

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.740
Why won't you listen?!

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:17.360
I'm doing this for you!

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.780
Being separated from us, your family,

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:24.140
and the emotional pain you had to endure, all of it is my responsibility!

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:26.460
I didn't do anything for you all of these years,

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:28.540
but from now on, I will protect you!

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:32.760
You just... don't want to let go of Ikuto...

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:34.740
What's wrong with that?

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.720
No parent wants to put their own child in danger!

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:42.890
Maybe that's true, but...

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:47.230
Who cares what happens to the Digimon? Or the Digital World?

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:49.620
As long as Ikuto's with us, it's okay!

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:50.750
You're wrong!

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:56.260
I'm human. But I was raised as Digimon.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:59.160
And I found out both lives are important to me.

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:00.530
That's why...

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:02.010
I'll protect the Digimon!

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:04.270
I'll protect the Digital World!

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.210
Ikuto...

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:07.130
Why?

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:08.630
Why won't you understand?

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:15.950
Misuzu...

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:23.640
We may be the ones who don't understand.

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:27.060
Dear...

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:32.520
Ikuto grew up burdened with many things that we don't know about.

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:38.100
He's found the path that he must follow.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:42.400
All we can do now is support his wishes with all of our might.

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:45.950
But we'll be separated from Ikuto again.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.500
We'll be letting him fight!

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:51.170
There are times when a boy must go to do what has to be done.

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:54.750
We're not being forced to separate from each other this time.

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.950
This time, we're sending him off.

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:00.170
Our bond

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:01.140
is right here.

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:09.310
We'll open the Digital Gate for you!

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:17.840
Got it.

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:19.590
We're racing against time here.

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:21.050
You guys go on ahead.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:22.540
I'll catch up.

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:23.120
Understood.

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:25.650
The Digital World, huh...?

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:26.580
Are you ready?

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:27.710
Yes.

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:29.540
The fight has only just begun.

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:44.440
Satsuma...

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:45.440
That was...

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:04.620
We're counting on you, Professor Noguchi.

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:08.410
Please...

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:09.870
have faith in my work.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:17.670
Miki!

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:18.980
Look at that!

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:22.630
They're here.

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:26.870
The Ministry of Confidentiality?

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:29.100
Aniki, we've gotta hurry!

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:33.350
Don't worry! I'll definitely get the Digital Gate to open!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.310
I <i>will</i>  open it at all costs!

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:43.430
Hi~

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.620
We meet again.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:47.580
Huh? Who are you?

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:50.510
Those are the two women we met the other day.

00:11:50.510 --> 00:11:53.130
The black-haired one is more my type,

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:55.960
but no one will ever get me to say that out loud.

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:59.550
It doesn't matter, your inner thoughts are all spilling out anyway.

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:02.510
Who are you people?

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:04.510
Unfortunately,

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:07.580
I don't feel the need to tell you.

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:17.850
Let's do this...

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:18.650
Contact!

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:28.050
It opened...

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:30.700
It worked! It's a success!

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:32.700
All right!

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:34.550
Thank you, Professor Noguchi!

00:12:35.640 --> 00:12:38.580
I'll keep the Gate maintained for Satsuma-san's arrival.

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:39.630
Now, hurry!

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:41.420
Yeah, we're counting on you!

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:42.700
Let's go, guys!

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:43.440
Yeah!

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:43.440
Yeah!

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:50.840
Ikuto...

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:53.220
Ikuto...

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:55.800
I thank you.

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:57.380
In the Digimon's place.

00:12:58.280 --> 00:12:59.360
Ikuto...

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:03.100
I, who can think such thoughts, exist here.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:06.860
That's... what makes me Ikuto.

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:12.230
Thank you for giving me life.

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:13.150
Dad.

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:13.940
Mom.

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.710
I'll go.

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:23.710
You mean, "I'll be back."

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:27.800
When you leave the house, that's what you say to your family.

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:31.010
That way, we can all say "I'm home," and "Welcome back," when you return.

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:33.490
I'll... be back!

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:36.390
Come back shafely!

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:47.340
PawnChessmon!

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:50.410
No way!

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:51.870
Now then, farewell!

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:54.960
Who are you?

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:56.370
Excuse us!

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:02.420
What?

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:04.730
With this, my space-time coefficients are...!

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:06.380
I knew they were after this place.

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:07.760
Satsuma-san.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.520
Kurosaki, Shirakawa.

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:10.340
Take care of the rest.

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:10.720
Yes, sir!

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:10.720
Yes, sir!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:12.170
You can't!

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:13.900
The Gate isn't stabilized!

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:15.370
Professor Noguchi.

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:17.390
I swear to you, I will protect Ikuto-kun.

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:19.390
Satsuma-san...

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:30.020
Just you wait, Kurata.

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:32.820
When I find you, you're going down.

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:36.670
A human?

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:38.330
What's he doing here?

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:42.390
Now then, I guess I'll add a new page to my autobiography.

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:44.330
I'll title it...

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:46.380
"The Great Digital Gate Massacre!"

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:47.880
What?

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:49.980
Just like always.

00:14:49.980 --> 00:14:52.890
You're quite the bloodthirsty one, Kouki.

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:55.350
Who are you guys?!

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:57.130
This time it's children.

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:58.890
Hmph, there's only one woman.

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:00.470
She's younger than the ones before.

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:02.200
She might be my type.

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:04.380
But no one will ever get me to say that out loud.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.820
Like I said, everyone can hear you.

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:08.420
Nanami, Ivan.

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:10.060
Let's settle this already.

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:13.780
Don't be a smart ass!

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:16.920
This is...!

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:18.700
Why is my Digisoul...?!

00:15:19.090 --> 00:15:20.500
The other guy is a human!

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:22.030
Human?

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:23.960
Don't lump me with you guys.

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:27.550
I'll show you.

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:29.300
Burn this into your memory!

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:32.260
We have surpassed mortal limits.

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:34.390
Now we'll make our declaration loud and clear!

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:41.190
Hyper Bio Evolution!

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.360
BioThunderBirmon!

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:54.320
Hyper Bio Evolution!

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:00.290
BioCoatlmon!

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:07.210
Hyper Bio Evolution!

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:13.260
BioStegomon!

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:25.730
BioCoatlmon

00:16:13.470 --> 00:16:25.730
BioThunderBirmon

00:16:13.470 --> 00:16:25.730
BioStegomon

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:15.370
BioThunderBirmon.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.590
BioCoatlmon.

00:16:16.590 --> 00:16:17.920
BioStegomon.

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:20.230
Bio Digimon that have been modified by Kurata.

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:25.730
Fused with humans, their modified versions are leveled up in speed and power.

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:28.730
This is our true form.

00:16:28.730 --> 00:16:31.640
Humans... transformed into Digimon!

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:32.790
No way!

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:33.700
That's impossible!

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:35.820
These guys are on Kurata's side!

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:36.960
What?

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:39.240
Then that means these Digimon are...

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:40.620
Our new enemy.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:42.770
Aniki, let's take 'em down!

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:43.390
Yeah!

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:44.620
That goes without saying!

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:46.430
Digisoul...

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:52.100
Full Charge!

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:56.470
Agumon, evolve!

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:07.770
RiseGreymon!

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:10.030
Digisoul...

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:10.030
Digisoul...

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:15.080
Full Charge!

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:15.080
Full Charge!

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:19.080
Gaomon, evolve!

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:31.710
MachGaogamon!

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.520
Lalamon, evolve!

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:47.980
Lilamon!

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:52.590
Ikuto, I'll fight too!

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:54.590
No! You're still hurt!

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:56.840
Let's end this!

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:58.150
Solid Strike!

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:05.410
What a tough defense.

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:08.860
Is that all you've got?

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.170
Lilac Dagger!

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:17.290
Trident Revolver!

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:20.850
Howling Cannon!

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:23.350
Marvel Shot!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:27.140
Did they get 'em?!

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:35.690
No way...

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:37.530
There's not even a scratch on them!

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:41.860
Your attacks don't even itch us, much less cause any pain!

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:43.610
Now it's our turn!

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:45.740
Have a small taste of our power!

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:48.680
Thunder Storm!

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:53.630
Winning Knuckle!

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:56.290
Freeze Wave!

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:58.790
Shell Needle Rain!

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:05.830
Gaomon!

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:07.930
Lalamon!

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:11.590
You think you can defeat us at your pathetic level?

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:13.110
Don't be ridiculous.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:14.770
You're too damn soft!

00:19:15.010 --> 00:19:15.750
Aniki...

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:17.230
They're too powerful!

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:19.240
I can't believe... they can do this...

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:20.600
Now you die!

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:21.620
Wait!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:24.880
Zekkou Shou!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:24.880
Perfect Shining

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:28.160
What?

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:29.380
Captain!

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:35.030
I will take over from here.

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:36.790
You guys will hurry to the Digital World!

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:37.820
But...!

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:39.350
That's an order!

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:41.260
Don't forget your mission!

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:43.580
Yes, sir!

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:43.580
Yes, sir!

00:19:46.090 --> 00:19:47.220
You bastards...

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:49.270
Do you wanna die that badly?

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:52.860
We fight only to continue living!

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:54.010
Let's go, Kudamon!

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:54.520
Yes!

00:19:57.280 --> 00:19:58.630
Digisoul...

00:19:58.630 --> 00:19:59.860
Full Charge!

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:03.690
Kudamon, evolve!

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:06.910
Qilinmon!

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:16.830
Qilinmon

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:16.830
Perfect Level

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:08.760
Qilinmon.

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:12.320
A Perfect Level Digimon who is as powerful as an Ultimate.

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:14.730
His special attack is Shippuu Tenshouken (The Blade that Soars through Hurricanes).

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.830
With his mighty horn, he cuts through his enemies!

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:19.300
You who desire only to destroy life...

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:20.800
Face my blade!

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.010
Don't make me laugh!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.410
Fools.

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:26.960
Jinsoku no Kokoroe!

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:26.960
Knowledge of the Swift

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:34.970
He hurt us!

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:35.900
Impossible!

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:40.070
It's the one who overestimates his own ability that loses!

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:41.400
Damn it...

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:42.550
Unforgivable!

00:20:53.240 --> 00:20:53.940
What?

00:20:54.660 --> 00:20:56.400
What happened?

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:58.380
CAPTAIN!

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:04.840
The Digital Gate!

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:08.680
Captain!

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:11.150
I hope he's okay...

00:21:11.150 --> 00:21:12.850
He must be.

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:15.040
After all, he's <i>our</i>  Captain.

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:15.810
You're right.

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:17.850
The Captain's orders...

00:21:17.850 --> 00:21:19.650
Mustn't forget them!

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:21.300
That's right!

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:24.390
There's something we have to do!

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:27.880
We'll definitely stop Kurata's ambitions...

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:30.740
and save the Digital World!

